{"insertText":{"location":{"index":144759,"tabId":"t.l5c18frq5wuo"},"text":"Figure X. Paired Differences in ROC-AUC Between Fixed-Recipe SwinFusion++ and Each Encoder\nNote. Points are ensemble ΔROC-AUC (SwinFusion++ minus comparator). Bars are unadjusted 95% percentile intervals from 5,000 stratified cluster-bootstrap draws. Filled markers denote Holm-adjusted p < 0.05 (rank-based cluster permutation test). Because the intervals are unadjusted, one interval excludes 0 without significance (DFo → C23 vs Video Swin-B). Panels use different x-scales. Abbreviations as in the transfer ROC-AUC heatmap."}},
